<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/33/msa@/~cl_41> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong seksyen 76, 77 dan 78. Pindaan seksyen 81"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/33/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/33/msa@/~cl_42> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/33/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/33/msa@> .
